<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed slightly lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 9.95 to 7772.09.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.16 to 465.01.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.01.</p>
<p>Decliners edged out advancers 1239 to 1227.</p>
<p>Volume was 414,278,690 compared with 566,942,410 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
